# Every category a thing can be, shared by every test.
#
# **Sean, 2026-09-16**: *All of the tests share the same instance of the game rules, so the rules
# for one test are the same as the rules for another.* **A category is part of that instance** - the
# suite exercises one ruleset, and which categories exist is a fact about the ruleset rather than
# about any one test's world.
#
# **So a test's `given` holds state and not vocabulary.** Territories, adjacencies and residencies
# vary from test to test; `scout` means the same thing in all of them.

{thing id:1 name:scout}
{thing id:2 name:labor}
{thing id:3 name:metal}
{thing id:4 name:extractor}
